  </div>
  <footer><span>Data: source brief; figure reference: figure_3.jpg</span><span>06 / 08</span></footer>
</section>

<section class="slide" id="company-size-and-purchasing">
  <header><div><div class="kicker">Company context + purchasing</div><h2>47% Work at Sub-100 Orgs; 62% Influence Tech Purchases</h2></div><div class="header-rule"></div></header>
