<section class="slide" id="key-takeaways">
  <header><div><div class="kicker">Hiring + retention actions</div><h2>Takeaways: What These Trends Mean for Hiring & Retention</h2></div><div class="header-rule"></div></header>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="takeaways">
      <div class="take-card"><b>Plan for more flexible talent</b><p>Full-time employment is softening in the U.S.; contracting and freelancing remain significant at 16%+ globally.</p></div>
